==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~14.67 seconds<sup>150f~440f</sup>.
*20 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The 2 Malizabeths can pose a bit of a challenge as their Mini-Wave can easily destroy your weaker meatshields if you're not careful. Use [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] to weaken the Malizabeths and [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] to take them out. Pink Nyanko Ranger can also Weaken the One Horn to make it easier to kill with the likes of [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Executioner]], etc., and Teacher Bear stand's no chance against a stack of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]].

